{"allegations": ["{
  "assessment": "revise",
  "findings": [
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "location": "src/App.tsx",
      "evidence": "The <img> element for the logo in the sidebar uses alt=\"\", which is appropriate for decorative images, but the logo is paired with the visible brand name 'TalkSprout' and a slogan. However, the <img> is not marked as aria-hidden, and the brand name is not explicitly marked as the site name for assistive technologies. This may cause confusion for screen reader users, as the logo is skipped but the brand name is not programmatically associated as the site identity.",
      "suggestedFix": "Add aria-hidden=\"true\" to the <img> element, and consider using <span role=\"presentation\"> for the logo. Optionally, use <span className=\"sr-only\">TalkSprout</span> for the brand name if the visible text is styled in a way that may not be read in order. Ensure the brand name is programmatically associated as the site name."
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "location": "src/App.tsx",
      "evidence": "The skip link <a className=\"skip\" href=\"#library\"> is present, but the target element <h1 id=\"library-heading\"> is not always present or visible depending on the route. If the user activates the skip link when the heading is not rendered, focus will not move as expected, reducing accessibility for keyboard and screen reader users.",
      "suggestedFix": "Ensure that the element with id=\"library-heading\" is always present and visible when the skip link is available, or dynamically hide the skip link when the target is not present."
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "location": "src/App.tsx",
      "evidence": "The <main> element contains a <header> with <h1 id=\"library-heading\">, but the heading is reused for different pages and may not always reflect the current page's main content. This can confuse screen reader users who rely on headings for navigation.",
      "suggestedFix": "Ensure that each page or major section has a unique and descriptive <h1> that accurately reflects the current content. Consider updating the heading dynamically based on the route."
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "location": "src/App.tsx",
      "evidence": "The <input id=\"practice-link\" readOnly value={url.href} /> in the modal does not have type=\"text\" specified. While the default is 'text', being explicit improves clarity and accessibility.",
      "suggestedFix": "Add type=\"text\" to the input element."
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "location": "src/GuideLibrary.tsx",
      "evidence": "The GuidePromptBlock component uses a <textarea> for displaying prompts, which is readOnly and focusable. However, there is no explicit aria-readonly or aria-disabled attribute, and the label is provided via aria-label. While this is mostly accessible, some screen readers may not announce the read-only state.",
      "suggestedFix": "Consider adding aria-readonly=\"true\" to the <textarea> for improved accessibility."
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "location": "src/App.tsx",
      "evidence": "The language switch button uses aria-label and title, but the button only shows an icon. While this is generally accessible, some users may benefit from visible text or an additional visually hidden label.",
      "suggestedFix": "Add a visually hidden <span className=\"sr-only\"> with the language name inside the button for improved accessibility."
    }
  ]
}", "{
  "assessment": "revise",
  "findings": [
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "location": "src/LearningLibrary.tsx",
      "evidence": "The <PromptDialog> in LearningLibrary is rendered with prompt={null}, message=\"\", manual={false}, copied={false}, copying={false}, onCopy={() => {}}. This disables the actual copy functionality for learning prompts, so the user cannot copy the prompt text from the dialog. This is inconsistent with the rest of the app and the intended functionality.",
      "suggestedFix": "Pass the selected prompt and actual copy/copying/manual/copied/message state and handlers to <PromptDialog> as in the main prompt dialog usage, so that copying works for learning prompts."
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "location": "src/LearningLibrary.tsx",
      "evidence": "The <PromptDialog> in LearningLibrary uses a hardcoded id=\"dialog-title\" for the <h2> element, but this id is also used in PromptDialog itself for aria-labelledby. If multiple dialogs are rendered, this could cause duplicate id issues.",
      "suggestedFix": "Use a unique id for the dialog title, e.g., by including the prompt id."
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "location": "src/LearningLibrary.tsx",
      "evidence": "The <textarea id=\"prompt-text\"> is always rendered with lang=\"en\" and spellCheck={false}, which is correct for English prompts, but if locale is not 'en', the label is in Chinese but the textarea is still lang=\"en\". This is not a bug, but could be confusing for screen readers.",
      "suggestedFix": "Consider clarifying in the label or description that the prompt is always in English, regardless of UI language."
    }
  ]
}", "{
  "assessment": "revise",
  "findings": [
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "location": "src/useRightEdgeBack.ts",
      "evidence": "The cleanup function in useEffect removes event listeners without specifying the same options (passive/capture) as when they were added. For example, 'touchstart' is added with { passive: true, capture: true } but removed with only 'true' (which is capture: true, but omits passive). This can result in event listeners not being properly removed, leading to memory leaks or duplicate handlers.",
      "suggestedFix": "Ensure that event listeners are removed with the exact same options as when they were added. For example, use { passive: true, capture: true } for removal of 'touchstart', and { passive: false, capture: true } for 'touchmove' and 'touchend'."
    }
  ]
}"], "sources": [{"path": "src/App.tsx", "content": "import "./quick-access.css";
import {
  lazy,
  Suspense,
  useEffect,
  useLayoutEffect,
  useRef,
  useState,
  type ReactNode,
} from "react";
import { allPrompts as sourcePrompts } from "./prompts";
import type { Prompt, PromptVariant, ReviewSource } from "./types";
import { FirstPracticeGuide } from "./FirstPracticeGuide";
import { SavedPracticeList, RecentList } from "./QuickAccess";
import { useSavedPrompts } from "./useSavedPrompts";
import { usePromptClipboard } from "./usePromptClipboard";
import { practiceHref, shortcutKey, type PracticeShortcut, type RecentPrompt } from "./shortcuts";
import { useNavigation, navigate, replacePromptOptions } from "./navigation";
import { useAppFrame } from "./useAppFrame";
import { useRightEdgeBack } from "./useRightEdgeBack";
import { collections } from "./content/collections";
import { Icon } from "./Icon";
import { Settings } from "./Settings";
import { LearningLibrary } from "./LearningLibrary";
import { guideTitles, canonicalGuideId, readingArticleIds } from "./content/guide-titles";
import { guideEntryId } from "./guides";
import { PromptLibrary } from "./PromptLibrary";
import { composeScene, type SceneSelection } from "./scenes";
import { promptText } from "./prompt-text";
import { useAppUpdate } from "./useAppUpdate";
import { UpdateBanner } from "./UpdateBanner";
import { PromptDialog } from "./PromptDialog";
import { dictionary, initialLocale, type Locale } from "./i18n";
const GuideLibrary = lazy(() => import("./GuideLibrary").then(module => ({ default: module.GuideLibrary })));
const prompts: Prompt[] = sourcePrompts;
let storage: Storage | null = null;
try {
  storage = window.localStorage;
} catch {}
export default function App() {
  const route = useNavigation();
  const guidesVisited = useRef(false);
  if (route.page === "guides") guidesVisited.current = true;
  const appUpdate = useAppUpdate();
  const { copying, writer } = usePromptClipboard();
  const savedPrompts = useSavedPrompts(storage);
  const [sceneSelection, setSceneSelection] = useState<SceneSelection>();
  const frame = useAppFrame(route.base);
  const lastPractice = useRef("#library");
  if (route.page === "practice") lastPractice.current = route.base;
  const [locale, setLocale] = useState<Locale>(initialLocale);
  const favorites = savedPrompts.favorites;
  const [modal, setModal] = useState<{
      prompt: Prompt | null;
      content: ReactNode;
    } | null>(null),
    [variant, setVariant] = useState<PromptVariant>("full"),
    [reviewSource, setReviewSource] = useState<ReviewSource>("current"),
    [message, setMessage] = useState(""),
    [manual, setManual] = useState(false),
    [copied, setCopied] = useState(false),
    [online, setOnline] = useState(navigator.onLine),
    [installed, setInstalled] = useState(
      () =>
        matchMedia("(display-mode: standalone)").matches ||
        !!(navigator as Navigator & { standalone?: boolean }).standalone,
    );
  const install = useRef<(Event & { prompt: () => Promise<void> }) | null>(
    null,
  );
  const localHydration = useRef<string | null>(null);
  const active = useRef(modal);
  active.current = modal;
  const t = dictionary[locale],
    en = locale === "en",
    s = (zh: string, english: string) => (en ? english : zh);
  useEffect(() => {
    document.documentElement.lang = locale;
    document.title =
      locale === "en"
        ? "TalkSprout · Start speaking English"
        : "TalkSprout 开口芽 · 和 AI 开口练英语";
    try {
      localStorage.setItem("talksprout:locale", locale);
    } catch {}
  }, [locale]);
  useEffect(() => {
    const connection = () => setOnline(navigator.onLine);
    const before = (e: Event) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      install.current = e as typeof install.current;
    };
    window.addEventListener("online", connection);
    window.addEventListener("offline", connection);
    window.addEventListener("beforeinstallprompt", before);
    return () => {
      window.removeEventListener("online", connection);
      window.removeEventListener("offline", connection);
      window.removeEventListener("beforeinstallprompt", before);
    };
  }, []);
  useEffect(() => {
    if (appUpdate.cacheUnavailable)
      setMessage(en ? "Offline cache unavailable." : "离线缓存暂不可用。");
  }, [appUpdate.cacheUnavailable, en]);
  useLayoutEffect(() => {
    writer.invalidate();
    setCopied(false);
    const preserveLocalState = localHydration.current === location.hash;
    localHydration.current = null;
    if (route.promptId) {
      const prompt = prompts.find((p) => p.id === route.promptId);
      if (prompt && !preserveLocalState) {
        setSceneSelection(route.sceneSelection);
        setVariant(route.format ?? "full");
        setReviewSource(route.reviewSource ?? "current");
        setManual(false);
        setMessage("");
        setModal({ prompt, content: null });
      }
    } else if (route.infoId) {
      info(route.infoId);
    } else if (active.current) {
      setModal(null);
      setMessage("");
      setManual(false);
    }
  }, [route.promptId, route.infoId, route.base, route.sceneSelection?.sceneId, route.sceneSelection?.pace, route.format, route.reviewSource]);
  const previousBase = useRef(route.base);
  useEffect(() => {
    const previous = previousBase.current;
    previousBase.current = route.base;
    if (route.promptId || route.learningPromptId || route.infoId) return;
    const focusedAtNavigation = document.activeElement;
    const frame = requestAnimationFrame(() => {
      if (document.querySelector("dialog[open]")) return;
      // Do not override focus the user moved after navigation but before this frame.
      const focused = document.activeElement;
      if (focused !== focusedAtNavigation && focused !== document.body && focused?.isConnected) return;
      const opener = previous.startsWith("#collection/") && route.base === "#library"
        ? document.querySelector<HTMLElement>(`[data-collection="${previous.slice("#collection/".length)}"]`)
        : null;
      const guideOpener = previous.startsWith("#guides/") && (route.base === "#guides" || route.base === "#guides?section=reading")
        ? document.getElementById(guideEntryId(canonicalGuideId(previous.slice("#guides/".length))))
        : null;
      (guideOpener ?? opener ?? document.getElementById("library-heading"))?.focus({ preventScroll: true });
    });
    return () => cancelAnimationFrame(frame);
  }, [route.base]);
  useEffect(() => {
    if (!message || modal) return;
    const timer = setTimeout(() => setMessage(""), 3500);
    return () => clearTimeout(timer);
  }, [message, modal]);
  useEffect(() => {
    const complete = () => setInstalled(true);
    window.addEventListener("appinstalled", complete);
    return () => window.removeEventListener("appinstalled", complete);
  }, []);
  const openPrompt = (p: Prompt, format: PromptVariant = "full", source: ReviewSource = "current", scene?: SceneSelection, preserveManual = false) => {
    const samePurpose = (p.kind === "review") === (route.page === "review");
    const base =
      samePurpose && route.page !== "settings"
        ? route.base
        : p.kind === "review"
          ? "#review"
          : "#library";
    const params = new URLSearchParams({ prompt: p.id });
    if (format === "spoken") params.set("format", "spoken");
    if (p.kind === "review" && source === "transcript") params.set("source", "transcript");
    if (p.kind !== "review" && scene) {
      params.set("scene", scene.sceneId);
      if (scene.pace === "mock") params.set("pace", "mock");
    }
    const href = `${base}?${params}`;
    if (preserveManual && location.hash !== href) localHydration.current = href;
    navigate(href, { talksproutPrompt: p.id });
  };
  const syncOptions = (format: PromptVariant, source: ReviewSource, scene?: SceneSelection) => {
    if (modal?.prompt) replacePromptOptions(route.base, modal.prompt.id, format, source, scene,
      hash => { localHydration.current = hash; });
  };
  const resetCopyFeedback = () => {
    writer.invalidate();
    setCopied(false);
    setManual(false);
    setMessage("");
  };
  const changeLocale = (next: Locale) => {
    resetCopyFeedback();
    setLocale(next);
  };
  const closeModal = () => {
    resetCopyFeedback();
    setModal(null);
    setMessage("");
    setManual(false);
    if (route.promptId) {
      if (history.state?.talksproutPrompt === route.promptId) history.back();
      else navigate(route.base);
    } else if (route.infoId) {
      if (history.state?.talksproutInfo === route.infoId) history.back();
      else navigate(route.base);
    }
  };
  useRightEdgeBack(
    modal
      ? () => {
          if (
            history.state?.talksproutSceneBrowser &&
            history.state?.talksproutSceneCoach === route.promptId
          )
            history.back();
          else closeModal();
        }
      : route.page === "guides" && route.guideId !== undefined
        ? () => {
            if (history.state?.talksproutGuide === route.guideId) history.back();
            else navigate(readingArticleIds.has(route.guideId ?? "") ? "#guides?section=reading" : "#guides");
          }
      : route.learningPromptId
        ? () => {
            if (history.state?.talksproutLearningPrompt === route.learningPromptId)
              history.back();
            else navigate("#learning");
          }
        : route.page === "learning"
          ? () => navigate("#library")
          : route.collection
            ? () => navigate("#library")
            : null,
    `${route.base}:${route.promptId ?? route.learningPromptId ?? ""}:${route.infoId ?? ""}`,
  );
  const detail = (p: Prompt) => {
    resetCopyFeedback();
    setSceneSelection(undefined);
    setVariant("full");
    setReviewSource("current");
    setMessage("");
    setManual(false);
    setModal({ prompt: p, content: null });
    openPrompt(p);
  };
  const shortcut = (p: Prompt, format: PromptVariant, scene?: SceneSelection): PracticeShortcut => ({
    promptId: p.id, variant: format, ...(scene ? { sceneId: scene.sceneId } : {}), pace: scene?.pace ?? "coached",
  });
  const copy = async (
    p: Prompt, format: PromptVariant = "full", source: ReviewSource = "current", scene?: SceneSelection,
  ) => {
    if (copying) return;
    setCopied(false);
    setManual(false);
    setMessage("");
    let persisted = true;
    await writer.write({
      text: promptText(composeScene(p, scene), format, source, locale),
      onDelivered: async () => {
        const entry: RecentPrompt = p.kind === "review"
          ? { kind: "review", promptId: p.id, variant: format, source }
          : { kind: "practice", ...shortcut(p, format, scene) };
        persisted = await savedPrompts.record(entry);
      },
      onSuccess: () => {
        const success = p.kind === "review"
          ? s("已复制！发送到 AI 聊天，整理复习材料。", "Copied! Send in your AI chat to create review material.")
          : t.copied;
        setCopied(true);
        setMessage(persisted ? success : `${success} ${t.saveError}`);
      },
      onFailure: () => {
        setModal({ prompt: p, content: null });
        setVariant(format);
        setReviewSource(source);
        setSceneSelection(scene);
        setManual(true);
        setMessage(t.manual);
        openPrompt(p, format, source, scene, true);
      },
    });
  };
  const info = (kind: "install" | "about") => {
    resetCopyFeedback();
    setMessage("");
    setModal({
      prompt: null,
      content: (
        <>
          <h2 id="dialog-title">
            {kind === "install"
              ? s("把开口芽放进口袋", "Take TalkSprout with you")
              : s("使用说明", "About TalkSprout")}
          </h2>
          {kind === "install" ? (
            <>
              <p>
                {s(
                  "iPhone 和 iPad：在 Safari 点“分享”，选择“添加到主屏幕”。",
                  "iPhone and iPad: in Safari, choose Share → Add to Home Screen.",
                )}
              </p>
              <p>
                {s(
                  "Android：浏览器菜单选择“安装应用”或“添加到主屏幕”。桌面：点击地址栏安装图标。",
                  "Android: choose Install app or Add to Home Screen in the browser menu. Desktop: use the install icon in the address bar.",
                )}
              </p>
              <p>
                {s(
                  "首次完整加载后可离线浏览缓存内容。外部 AI 需要网络。",
                  "After a full online visit, cached content works offline. External AI requires internet access.",
                )}
              </p>
            </>
          ) : (
            <>
              <p>
                {s(
                  "选择练习 → 复制提示词 → 粘贴到外部 AI → 选择语音或文字练习。",
                  "Choose practice → copy the prompt → paste into an external AI → practice by voice or text.",
                )}
              </p>
              <p>
                {s(
                  "开始练习用于对话开头；结束与复习用于原来的对话结束后，整理笔记、句子、词汇或自测卡片。两类各有简短语音版本。",
                  "Start practice sets up a new conversation. Wrap-up & Review turns an existing chat into notes, sentences, vocabulary, or self-study cards. Both offer short spoken versions.",
                )}
              </p>
              <p>{s(
                "听读写辅助有独立收藏。常用组合保存教练、场景与练习方式；分享链接和最近复制都不包含补充背景。复习和听读写辅助的讲解语言跟随界面选择；陪练以英语练习为主，可向 AI 请求中文帮助。",
                "Learning helpers have separate favorites. Saved combinations keep the coach, scenario and format. Links and recent copies exclude extra background. Review and learning-helper explanations follow the interface language. Conversation coaches focus on English practice; ask your AI for Chinese help when needed.",
              )}</p>
              <p>
                {s(
                  "无账号、无分析追踪。收藏、最近复制和语言保存在本机，清除浏览器数据会移除记录。本站不保存 AI 聊天。",
                  "No accounts or analytics. Favorites, recent copies and language are stored locally; clearing browser data removes them. AI conversations are not stored here.",
                )}
              </p>
              <p>
                {s(
                  "等级与时长为练习建议。",
                  "Levels and durations are practice suggestions.",
                )}
              </p>
            </>
          )}
        </>
      ),
    });
    navigate(`${route.base}?info=${kind}`, { talksproutInfo: kind });
  };
  const currentCollection = collections.find((c) => c.id === route.collection);
  const currentGuideTitle = route.guideId ? guideTitles[route.guideId] : undefined;
  const title =
    route.page === "guides"
      ? currentGuideTitle?.[locale] ?? s("学习指南", "Learning guides")
      : route.page === "learning"
      ? s("听读写辅助", "Listening, reading & writing")
      : route.page === "settings"
        ? s("设置", "Settings")
        : route.page === "review"
          ? s("结束与复习", "Wrap-up & Review")
          : currentCollection
            ? en
              ? currentCollection.titleEn
              : currentCollection.category
            : s("开始练习", "Start practice");
  return (
    <div className={`app-shell${frame.keyboardOpen ? " keyboard-open" : ""}${route.page === "guides" && route.guideId !== undefined ? " guide-reading" : ""}`}>
      <a
        className="skip"
        href="#library"
        onClick={(event) => {
          event.preventDefault();
          document
            .getElementById("library-heading")
            ?.focus({ preventScroll: true });
        }}
      >
        {s("跳到内容", "Skip to content")}
      </a>
      <aside className="app-sidebar">
        <a
          className="brand"
          href="#library"
          onClick={(event) => {
            event.preventDefault();
            navigate("#library");
          }}
        >
          <img
            src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}icons/icon.svg`}
            alt=""
            width="38"
            height="38"
          />
          <span>
            TalkSprout
            <small>{s("开口芽", "English, a little every day")}</small>
          </span>
        </a>
        <nav className="app-nav" aria-label={s("主导航", "Primary navigation")}>
          {(["practice", "review", "guides", "settings"] as const).map((page) => {
            const href =
              page === "practice"
                ? route.page === "practice"
                  ? "#library"
                  : lastPractice.current
                : page === "review"
                  ? "#review"
                  : page === "guides"
                    ? "#guides"
                    : "#settings";
            return (
              <a
                key={page}
                href={href}
                aria-current={
                  route.page === page ||
                  (page === "practice" && route.page === "learning")
                    ? "page"
                    : undefined
                }
                onClick={(event) => {
                  event.preventDefault();
                  if (location.hash === href)
                    frame.scrollRef.current?.scrollTo({
                      top: 0,
                      behavior: matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)")
                        .matches
                        ? "auto"
                        : "smooth",
                    });
                  else navigate(href);
                }}
              >
                <Icon name={page === "guides" ? "book" : page} />
                <span>
                  {page === "practice"
                    ? s("开始练习", "Start practice")
                    : page === "review"
                      ? s("结束与复习", "Wrap-up & Review")
                      : page === "guides"
                        ? s("学习指南", "Learning guides")
                        : s("设置", "Settings")}
                </span>
              </a>
            );
          })}
        </nav>
        <p className="sidebar-note">
          {s("开口练习，回顾积累。", "Practice, review, and keep growing.")}
        </p>
      </aside>
      <main className="app-main">
        <header className="app-header">
          {((route.page === "practice" && route.collection) ||
            route.page === "learning") && (
            <button
              className="back-button icon-button"
              aria-label={
                route.page === "learning"
                  ? s("← 返回练习", "← Back to practice")
                  : s("← 返回分类", "← Back to collections")
              }
              onClick={() => navigate("#library")}
            >
              <Icon name="back" />
            </button>
          )}
          <div className="header-title">
            <span className="eyebrow">TalkSprout</span>
            <h1 id="library-heading" tabIndex={-1}>
              {title}
            </h1>
          </div>
          <span id="connection" className="connection" data-online={online}>
            {online
              ? s("随时，开口练习", "Practice anytime")
              : s("离线模式 · 练习依然在", "Offline · keep practicing")}
          </span>
          <button
            className="icon-button language-shortcut"
            aria-label={en ? "中文" : "English"}
            title={en ? "中文" : "English"}
            onClick={() => changeLocale(en ? "zh" : "en")}
          >
            <Icon name="language" />
          </button>
        </header>
        <UpdateBanner
          snapshot={appUpdate.snapshot}
          completed={appUpdate.completed}
          locale={locale}
          onUpdate={appUpdate.requestUpdate}
        />
        <div
          className="page-scroll"
          data-testid="page-scroll"
          ref={frame.scrollRef}
          onScroll={frame.onScroll}
          role="region"
          aria-label={s("页面内容", "Page content")}
          tabIndex={0}
        >
          <div
            className="workspace"
            hidden={route.page === "settings" || route.page === "learning" || route.page === "guides"}
          >
            <PromptLibrary
              locale={locale}
              purpose={route.page === "review" ? "review" : "practice"}
              collection={route.collection}
              favorites={favorites}
              copying={copying}
              onDetail={detail}
              onCopy={(p) => void copy(p)}
              homeExtras={<>
                <FirstPracticeGuide locale={locale} />
                <SavedPracticeList items={savedPrompts.shortcuts} locale={locale} onRemove={(item) => { void savedPrompts.toggleShortcut(item).then(ok => { if (!ok) setMessage(t.saveError); }); }} />
                <RecentList items={savedPrompts.recent.filter(item => item.kind === "practice")} locale={locale} />
              </>}
              reviewExtras={<RecentList items={savedPrompts.recent.filter(item => item.kind === "review")} locale={locale} />}
              onFavorite={(id) => {
                void savedPrompts.toggleFavorite(id).then(ok => { if (!ok) setMessage(t.saveError); });
              }}
            />
          </div>
          {route.page === "learning" && (
            <div className="workspace">
              <LearningLibrary
                locale={locale}
                promptId={route.learningPromptId}
                copying={copying}
                writer={writer}
                favorites={savedPrompts.learningFavorites}
                recent={savedPrompts.recent.filter(item => item.kind === "learning")}
                onFavorite={(id) => { void savedPrompts.toggleLearningFavorite(id).then(ok => { if (!ok) setMessage(t.saveError); }); }}
                onDelivered={(id) => savedPrompts.record({ kind: "learning", promptId: id })}
              />
            </div>
          )}
          {guidesVisited.current && <div className="workspace" hidden={route.page !== "guides"}>
            <Suspense fallback={<p role="status">{s("正在打开学习指南…", "Opening learning guides…")}</p>}>
              <GuideLibrary locale={locale} writer={writer} copying={copying} shelf={route.guideShelf} guideId={route.page === "guides" ? route.guideId : undefined} />
            </Suspense>
          </div>}
          {route.page === "settings" && (
            <div className="workspace">
              <Settings
                locale={locale}
                onLocale={changeLocale}
                online={online}
                installed={installed}
                offlineStatus={appUpdate.offlineStatus}
                onAbout={() => info("about")}
                onInstall={() => {
                  if (install.current) {
                    void install.current.prompt();
                    install.current = null;
                  } else info("install");
                }}
              />
            </div>
          )}
        </div>
      </main>
      {!modal && !route.learningPromptId && (
        <div
          id="toast"
          role="status"
          aria-live="polite"
          className={message ? "visible" : ""}
        >
          {message}
        </div>
      )}
      {modal && (
        <PromptDialog
          locale={locale}
          prompt={
            modal.prompt ? composeScene(modal.prompt, sceneSelection) : null
          }
          practiceActions={modal.prompt && modal.prompt.kind !== "review" ? (() => {
            const entry = shortcut(modal.prompt, variant, sceneSelection);
            const stored = savedPrompts.shortcuts.some(item => shortcutKey(item) === shortcutKey(entry));
            const url = new URL(location.href);
            url.search = "";
            url.hash = practiceHref(entry);
            return <div className="practice-actions">
              <button className="save-combination" aria-pressed={stored} onClick={() => { void savedPrompts.toggleShortcut(entry).then(ok => { if (!ok) setMessage(t.saveError); }); }}>{stored ? s("移除常用组合", "Remove practice combination") : s("保存常用组合", "Save practice combination")}</button>
              <details><summary>{s("分享练习链接", "Share practice link")}</summary>
                <label htmlFor="practice-link">{s("教练、场景与练习方式", "Coach, scenario and format")}</label>
                <input id="practice-link" readOnly value={url.href} />
                <button disabled={copying} onClick={() => {
                  setCopied(false); setManual(false); setMessage("");
                  void writer.write({ text: url.href,
                    onSuccess: () => setMessage(s("练习链接已复制。", "Practice link copied.")),
                    onFailure: () => { const field = document.getElementById("practice-link") as HTMLInputElement | null; field?.focus(); field?.select(); setMessage(s("请手动复制上方链接。", "Select and copy the link manually.")); },
                  });
                }}>{s("复制练习链接", "Copy practice link")}</button>
              </details>
              <small>{s("只保存练习选择，不包含补充背景。", "Only practice choices are saved; extra background is excluded.")}</small>
            </div>;
          })() : undefined}
          sceneSelection={sceneSelection}
          onSceneChange={(next) => {
            resetCopyFeedback();
            setSceneSelection(next);
            syncOptions(variant, reviewSource, next);
          }}
          content={modal.content}
          message={message}
          manual={manual}
          copied={copied}
          copying={copying}
          variant={variant}
          reviewSource={reviewSource}
          onSourceChange={(source) => {
            resetCopyFeedback();
            setReviewSource(source);
            syncOptions(variant, source, sceneSelection);
            setMessage("");
            setManual(false);
          }}
          onVariantChange={(format) => {
            resetCopyFeedback();
            setVariant(format);
            syncOptions(format, reviewSource, sceneSelection);
            setMessage("");
            setManual(false);
          }}
          onClose={closeModal}
          onCopy={(_p, format) => {
            if (modal.prompt)
              void copy(modal.prompt, format, reviewSource, sceneSelection);
          }}
        />
      )}
    </div>
  );
}
"}, {"path": "src/LearningLibrary.tsx", "content": "import { useLayoutEffect, useRef, useState } from "react";
import { learningGroups, learningPrompts, type LearningSkill } from "./content/learning";
import { navigate } from "./navigation";
import { PromptDialog } from "./PromptDialog";
import { Icon } from "./Icon";
import { learningPromptText } from "./prompt-text";
import { RecentList } from "./QuickAccess";
import type { ClipboardWriter } from "./clipboard-writer";
import type { RecentPrompt } from "./shortcuts";
import "./learning-library.css";
import type { Locale } from "./types";

interface Props {
  locale: Locale;
  promptId: string | null;
  copying: boolean;
  writer: ClipboardWriter;
  favorites: string[];
  recent: RecentPrompt[];
  onFavorite: (id: string) => void;
  onDelivered: (id: string) => Promise<boolean>;
}

export function LearningLibrary({ locale, promptId, copying, writer, favorites, recent, onFavorite, onDelivered }: Props) {
  const en = locale === "en";
  const selected = learningPrompts.find((p) => p.id === promptId);
  const [skill, setSkill] = useState<LearningSkill>(selected?.skill ?? "listening");
  const [copied, setCopied] = useState(false);
  const [manual, setManual] = useState(false);
  const [message, setMessage] = useState("");
  const [savedOnly, setSavedOnly] = useState(false);
  const text = useRef<HTMLTextAreaElement>(null);
  const group = learningGroups.find((item) => item.id === skill)!;
  const visiblePrompts = learningPrompts.filter((p) => p.skill === skill && (!savedOnly || favorites.includes(p.id)));

  useLayoutEffect(() => {
    if (selected) setSkill(selected.skill);
  }, [selected]);
  useLayoutEffect(() => {
    writer.invalidate();
    setCopied(false);
    setManual(false);
    setMessage("");
    return () => { writer.invalidate(); };
  }, [promptId, locale, writer]);
  useLayoutEffect(() => {
    if (manual) {
      text.current?.focus();
      text.current?.select();
    }
  }, [manual]);

  const close = () => {
    writer.invalidate();
    if (history.state?.talksproutLearningPrompt === promptId) history.back();
    else navigate("#learning");
  };
  const copy = async () => {
    if (!selected || copying) return;
    setCopied(false);
    setManual(false);
    setMessage("");
    let persisted = true;
    await writer.write({
      text: learningPromptText(selected, locale),
      onDelivered: async () => { persisted = await onDelivered(selected.id); },
      onSuccess: () => {
        setCopied(true);
        setMessage((en ? "Copied! Paste into your AI with the material." : "已复制！粘贴到常用 AI，并提供相关材料。") +
          (persisted ? "" : en ? " Recent history could not be saved on this device." : " 最近复制记录未能保存在本机。"));
      },
      onFailure: () => {
        setManual(true);
        setMessage(en ? "Copy unavailable. Select and copy the prompt manually." : "自动复制不可用，请手动复制已选中的提示词。");
      },
    });
  };

  return (
    <section className="learning-library" aria-label={en ? "Extra learning prompts" : "辅助学习提示词"}>
      <p className="view-caption">
        {en ? "Something hard to follow or put into words? Pick a task and take it to your AI." : "听不懂、读不透、写不顺？选一个需求，带去常用 AI。"}
      </p>
      <div className="learning-directions" role="group" aria-label={en ? "Learning direction" : "学习方向"}>
        {learningGroups.map((item) => (
          <button
            key={item.id}
            aria-pressed={skill === item.id}
            onClick={() => setSkill(item.id)}
          >
            <span className="direction-emoji" aria-hidden="true">{item.emoji}</span>
            <strong>{item.title[locale]}</strong>
          </button>
        ))}
      </div>
      <RecentList items={recent} locale={locale} />
      <button className="learning-saved-filter" aria-label={en ? "Saved only" : "只看收藏"} aria-pressed={savedOnly} onClick={() => setSavedOnly(!savedOnly)}>
        <Icon name="heart" />{en ? "Saved only" : "只看收藏"}
      </button>
      <section className={`learning-group learning-${skill}`} aria-labelledby="learning-group-title">
        <div className="learning-group-heading">
          <h2 className="section-label" id="learning-group-title">{group.title[locale]}</h2>
          <span>{en ? `${visiblePrompts.length} prompts` : `${visiblePrompts.length} 个提示词`}</span>
        </div>
        <p className="learning-group-description">{group.description[locale]}</p>
        <div className="native-list learning-list">
          {visiblePrompts.length === 0 && <p className="learning-empty">{en ? "No saved prompts in this direction yet." : "这个方向还没有收藏的提示词。"}</p>}
          {visiblePrompts.map((p) => (
            <div className="learning-prompt-row" key={p.id}>
            <button
              className="learning-prompt"
              key={p.id}
              data-learning-prompt={p.id}
              onClick={() => navigate(`#learning?prompt=${p.id}`, { talksproutLearningPrompt: p.id })}
            >
              <span className="learning-prompt-emoji" aria-hidden="true">{p.emoji}</span>
              <span className="learning-prompt-text">
                <strong>{p.title[locale]}</strong>
                <small>{p.description[locale]}</small>
                <span className="learning-examples">{p.examples[locale]}</span>
              </span>
              <Icon name="chevron" />
            </button>
            <button className="learning-favorite icon-button" aria-label={`${favorites.includes(p.id) ? (en ? "Unsave" : "取消收藏") : (en ? "Save" : "收藏")}：${p.title[locale]}`} aria-pressed={favorites.includes(p.id)} onClick={() => onFavorite(p.id)}>
              <Icon name="heart" />
            </button>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>
      <p className="section-note">{en ? "Copy → paste into your AI → provide the material there. No uploads needed here." : "复制 → 粘贴给 AI → 在那里提供材料，这里无需上传。"}</p>
      {selected && (
        <PromptDialog
          key={selected.id}
          locale={locale}
          prompt={null}
          message=""
          manual={false}
          copied={false}
          copying={false}
          onClose={close}
          onCopy={() => {}}
          content={<>
            <h2 id="dialog-title" className="learning-detail-title">
              <span aria-hidden="true">{selected.emoji}</span>{selected.title[locale]}
            </h2>
            <p>{selected.description[locale]}</p>
            <p className="learning-detail-examples">{selected.examples[locale]}</p>
            <p className="requirement"><strong>{en ? "Preparation: " : "准备："}</strong>{selected.preparation[locale]}</p>
            <p>{selected.guide[locale]}</p>
            <label htmlFor="prompt-text">{en ? "English prompt" : "英文提示词"}</label>
            <textarea id="prompt-text" ref={text} value={learningPromptText(selected, locale)} readOnly lang="en" spellCheck={false} />
          </>}
          footer={<footer className="sheet-footer">
            <button className="primary modal-copy learning-copy" disabled={copying} aria-busy={copying} onClick={() => void copy()}>
              <Icon name="copy" />
              {copying ? (en ? "Copying…" : "正在复制…") : copied ? (en ? "Copied ✓" : "已复制 ✓") : (en ? "Copy prompt" : "复制提示词")}
            </button>
            <p role={manual ? "alert" : "status"} aria-live="polite" className={manual ? "manual-note" : ""}>{message}</p>
          </footer>}
        />
      )}
    </section>
  );
}
"}, {"path": "src/PromptDialog.tsx", "content": "import { useEffect, useRef, type ReactNode } from "react";
import { ScenarioPicker } from "./ScenarioPicker";
import type { SceneSelection } from "./scenes";
import { Icon } from "./Icon";
import { promptText } from "./prompt-text";
import { dictionary, metadata, categoryEnglish, type Locale } from "./i18n";
import type { Prompt, PromptVariant, ReviewSource } from "./types";
export function PromptDialog({
  prompt: p,
  content,
  message,
  manual,
  copied,
  copying,
  onClose,
  onCopy,
  locale,
  variant = "full",
  onVariantChange,
  reviewSource = "current",
  onSourceChange,
  sceneSelection,
  onSceneChange,
  footer,
  practiceActions,
}: {
  footer?: ReactNode;
  practiceActions?: ReactNode;
  sceneSelection?: SceneSelection;
  onSceneChange?: (selection?: SceneSelection) => void;
  locale: Locale;
  prompt: Prompt | null;
  content: ReactNode;
  message: string;
  manual: boolean;
  copied: boolean;
  copying: boolean;
  onClose: () => void;
  onCopy: (p: Prompt, variant: PromptVariant) => void;
  reviewSource?: ReviewSource;
  onSourceChange?: (source: ReviewSource) => void;
  variant?: PromptVariant;
  onVariantChange?: (variant: PromptVariant) => void;
}) {
  const en = locale === "en",
    t = dictionary[locale],
    s = (zh: string, english: string) => (en ? english : zh);
  const reviewing = p?.kind === "review";
  const spokenLabel = reviewing
    ? s("语音结尾提示", "Spoken wrap-up")
    : s("语音开场白", "Spoken opening");
  const selectedText = p ? promptText(p, variant, reviewSource, locale) : "";
  const ref = useRef<HTMLDialogElement>(null);
  const text = useRef<HTMLTextAreaElement>(null);
  useEffect(() => {
    const d = ref.current!;
    const previous = document.activeElement as HTMLElement | null;
    const originBase = location.hash.split("?")[0];
    d.showModal();
    return () => {
      d.close();
      requestAnimationFrame(() => {
        if (document.querySelector("dialog[open]") || location.hash.split("?")[0] !== originBase) return;
        const focused = document.activeElement;
        if (focused !== document.body && focused?.isConnected && focused !== previous) return;
        if (previous?.isConnected) previous.focus({ preventScroll: true });
        else
          document
            .querySelector<HTMLElement>("#library-heading")
            ?.focus({ preventScroll: true });
      });
    };
  }, []);
  useEffect(() => {
    if (manual) {
      text.current?.focus();
      text.current?.select();
    }
  }, [manual, p, variant, reviewSource]);
  return (
    <dialog
      id="detail"
      className="prompt-sheet"
      ref={ref}
      aria-labelledby="dialog-title"
      onCancel={(event) => {
        event.preventDefault();
        onClose();
      }}
      onClick={(e) => {
        if (e.target !== e.currentTarget) return;
        const r = e.currentTarget.getBoundingClientRect();
        if (
          e.clientX < r.left ||
          e.clientX > r.right ||
          e.clientY < r.top ||
          e.clientY > r.bottom
        )
          onClose();
      }}
    >
      <header className="sheet-toolbar">
        {p ? (
          <div>
            <div className="eyebrow">
              {en ? categoryEnglish[p.category] : p.category}
              {p.kind !== "review" && ` · ${p.level}`}
            </div>
            <h2 id="dialog-title">{en ? p.english : p.title}</h2>
          </div>
        ) : (
          <span className="sheet-brand">TalkSprout</span>
        )}
        <button
          className="modal-close icon-button"
          aria-label={t.close}
          onClick={onClose}
        >
          <Icon name="close" />
        </button>
      </header>
      <div className="sheet-content">
        {p ? (
          <>
            {!en && <p className="english-title">{p.english}</p>}
            {onSceneChange && (
              <ScenarioPicker
                key={p.id}
                prompt={p}
                locale={locale}
                selection={sceneSelection}
                onChange={onSceneChange}
              />
            )}
            {practiceActions}
            <div
              className="prompt-formats"
              role="tablist"
              aria-label={s("使用方式", "Prompt format")}
              onKeyDown={(event) => {
                let next: PromptVariant;
                if (event.key === "Home") next = "full";
                else if (event.key === "End") next = "spoken";
                else if (
                  event.key === "ArrowRight" ||
                  event.key === "ArrowLeft"
                )
                  next = variant === "full" ? "spoken" : "full";
                else return;
                event.preventDefault();
                onVariantChange?.(next);
                document.getElementById(`format-${next}`)?.focus();
              }}
            >
              <button
                role="tab"
                id="format-full"
                tabIndex={variant === "full" ? 0 : -1}
                aria-selected={variant === "full"}
                aria-controls="prompt-panel"
                onClick={() => onVariantChange?.("full")}
              >
                {s("完整提示词", "Full prompt")}
              </button>
              <button
                role="tab"
                id="format-spoken"
                tabIndex={variant === "spoken" ? 0 : -1}
                aria-selected={variant === "spoken"}
                aria-controls="prompt-panel"
                onClick={() => onVariantChange?.("spoken")}
              >
                {spokenLabel}
              </button>
            </div>
            <section
              id="prompt-panel"
              role="tabpanel"
              aria-labelledby={
                variant === "spoken" ? "format-spoken" : "format-full"
              }
            >
              {variant === "full" ? (
                <>
                  <p>{metadata(p, "description", locale)}</p>
                  <div className="modal-facts">
                    {p.kind !== "review" && (
                      <span>
                        {s("建议 ", "Suggested ")}
                        {p.minutes}
                        {s(" 分钟", " min")}
                      </span>
                    )}
                    <span>{metadata(p, "feedback", locale)}</span>
                  </div>
                  <details className="usage-guide">
                    <summary>
                      {reviewing
                        ? s("怎么用", "How to use")
                        : s("怎么练", "How to practice")}
                    </summary>
                    <p>{metadata(p, "guide", locale)}</p>
                    <p className="requirement">
                      {s("准备：", "Preparation: ")}
                      {metadata(p, "requires", locale)}
                    </p>
                  </details>
                </>
              ) : (
                <>
                  <p>
                    {reviewing
                      ? s(
                          "聊天结束时，在原来的 AI 语音对话里念下面这段英文。优先请求书面材料；只能语音回复时，改为简短口头复盘。",
                          "Read this in your existing AI voice chat when practice ends. Request written material if available; otherwise, use a brief spoken recap.",
                        )
                      : s(
                          "不方便粘贴时，在 AI 语音对话开始时照着念下面这段英文，念完后等 AI 提问。",
                          "If you cannot paste text, read this aloud at the start of your AI voice conversation, then let the AI begin.",
                        )}
                  </p>
                  <p className="spoken-duration">
                    {s("朗读约 ", "About ")}
                    {Math.ceil(
                      ((selectedText.trim().split(/\s+/).length / 140) * 60) /
                        5,
                    ) * 5}
                    –
                    {Math.ceil(
                      ((selectedText.trim().split(/\s+/).length / 100) * 60) /
                        5,
                    ) * 5}
                    {s(
                      " 秒，因语速而异",
                      " seconds to read, depending on pace",
                    )}
                  </p>
                </>
              )}
              {reviewing && variant === "full" && (
                <div className="review-source">
                  <label htmlFor="review-source">
                    {s("整理哪段聊天", "Conversation source")}
                  </label>
                  <select
                    id="review-source"
                    value={reviewSource}
                    onChange={(event) =>
                      onSourceChange?.(event.target.value as ReviewSource)
                    }
                  >
                    <option value="current">
                      {s("当前 AI 聊天", "Current AI chat")}
                    </option>
                    <option value="transcript">
                      {s("其他聊天记录", "Another transcript")}
                    </option>
                  </select>
                  <p>
                    {reviewSource === "transcript"
                      ? s(
                          "复制后，先将模板末尾的占位文字替换为聊天记录（注明说话人），再发给 AI。本站不读取聊天记录。",
                          "After copying, replace the placeholder at the end with a speaker-labeled transcript before sending. This site does not read your conversations.",
                        )
                      : s(
                          "在原来的 AI 聊天中发送。AI 只能整理它当前能读取的内容，无法找回已丢失的上下文。",
                          "Send in your original AI chat. The AI can review only the context it still has access to.",
                        )}
                  </p>
                </div>
              )}
              {variant === "full" || manual ? (
                <>
                  <label htmlFor="prompt-text">
                    {variant === "spoken"
                      ? spokenLabel
                      : s("完整英文提示词", "Full English prompt")}
                  </label>
                  <textarea
                    id="prompt-text"
                    ref={text}
                    readOnly
                    lang="en"
                    spellCheck={false}
                    value={selectedText}
                  />
                </>
              ) : (
                <div
                  className="spoken-script"
                  lang="en"
                  aria-label={spokenLabel}
                >
                  {selectedText.split("\n").map((sentence, i) => (
                    <p key={i}>{sentence}</p>
                  ))}
                </div>
              )}
            </section>
            <p className="fineprint">
              {reviewing
                ? s(
                    "在已有对话结束后使用。本站只提供提示词，不接收或保存 AI 聊天。",
                    "Use after an existing conversation. This site provides prompts; it does not receive or store AI chats.",
                  )
                : variant === "spoken"
                  ? s(
                      "在 AI 语音对话开始时，照着上面的英文念一遍，再等待 AI 回应。",
                      "Read the English opening aloud when your AI voice conversation starts, then wait for its reply.",
                    )
                  : s(
                      "粘贴到常用 AI，按练习模式开启语音或文字对话。本站不接收或保存 AI 聊天。",
                      "Paste into your AI and start by voice or text. This site does not store AI conversations.",
                    )}
            </p>
            {!reviewing && (
              <details className="chat-tips">
                <summary>
                  {s(
                    "和 AI 聊天时，可以这样说",
                    "Things you can say to your AI",
                  )}
                </summary>
                <p>
                  {s(
                    "开始练习后，在你使用的 AI 聊天里，直接用英文说：",
                    "Once practice starts, say these phrases in your AI chat:",
                  )}
                </p>
                <dl>
                  <div>
                    <dt lang="en">Help, please.</dt>
                    <dd>
                      {s(
                        "不知道怎么表达时，请 AI 给一个英文示例或简短提示。",
                        "Ask for a short hint or an English example when you get stuck.",
                      )}
                    </dd>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <dt lang="en">Review, please.</dt>
                    <dd>
                      {s(
                        "请 AI 回顾刚才练过的表达和需要改进的地方。",
                        "Ask the AI to recap expressions you practiced and useful improvements.",
                      )}
                    </dd>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <dt lang="en">Let's finish.</dt>
                    <dd>
                      {s(
                        "告诉 AI 今天先聊到这里，请它做一个简短总结。",
                        "Tell the AI you want to stop and get a short summary.",
                      )}
                    </dd>
                  </div>
                </dl>
              </details>
            )}
          </>
        ) : (
          content
        )}
      </div>
      {footer}
      {p && (
        <footer className="sheet-footer">
          {" "}
          <button
            className="primary modal-copy"
            data-copy={p.id}
            data-variant={variant}
            disabled={copying}
            aria-busy={copying}
            onClick={() => onCopy(p, variant)}
          >
            {copying
              ? s("正在复制…", "Copying…")
